      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "This proposed shift toward aggressive ESG integration offers a crucial competitive advantage, moving us from risk mitigation to value creation. By embedding social and environmental impact into our core strategy, we can attract capital from an increasingly ESG-mandated investor base, enhancing our market appeal. Furthermore, proactively addressing climate and social risks future-proofs our operations against regulatory changes and shifts in consumer preference, building long-term resilience beyond quarterly returns.",
