    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. some of the directors are gonna push back though. they're worried about the \"fiduciary duty\" aspect—like, that we should be focusing on maximizing profit for shareholders instead of spending money on stuff like social justice or environmental stuff that might not have an immediate ROI. \n\ncan you draft a rebuttal to that? basically show them why prioritizing these social/env goals is actually the most responsible way to protect shareholder value in the long run.",
