      "content": "that's a solid argument. but what about the critics who say this is just \"woke capitalism\" or a distraction from actual business? some of the more conservative members of the board feel like these ESG metrics are just ideological tools being used to push a political agenda that has nothing to do with running a company. \n\ndo you think those critics have a valid point, or are they just misinterpreting what ESG is actually for?",
